{
  "spec_version": 1,
  "id": "mixed-demo",
  "label": "应用包示范：同一旅程混用 web + cli + ssh + stdio（真实 sshd + 真实交互进程）",
  "goal": "加购一件商品 → cli 产出令牌 → 真实 ssh 把令牌写到远端再读回 → cli 消费远端值 → 浏览器用数据集里的优惠券码填表并应用 → 玩一局真实交互式猜数字游戏 → cli 消费游戏的返回值",
  "model": "english",
  "max_subgoals": 8,
  "journey": [
    {
      "id": "web-cart",
      "adapter": "web",
      "desc": "把 TrailBottle 加入购物车（web 步）",
      "start_url": "bench/fixtures/shop_home.html",
      "target_hint": "[data-test=add-to-cart]",
      "signal": { "css_text_equals": ["[data-test=cart-count]", "1"] },
      "retries": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "produce-token",
      "adapter": "cli",
      "desc": "cli：产出一个令牌（returns → 数据集）",
      "source": "demo-tool",
      "args": ["--query=widgets"],
      "signal": { "exit_ok": true },
      "returns": { "token": { "from": "stdout_regex", "pattern": "\"query\":\\s*\"([a-z]+)\"" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "remote",
      "adapter": "ssh",
      "desc": "ssh：把令牌写到远端再读回，并从同一次远端输出里抽出优惠券码",
      "ssh": {
        "host": "localhost",
        "argv": [
          "mkdir -p {out_dir} && echo {dataset:token} > {out_dir}/ssh-token && cat {out_dir}/ssh-token && printf 'ACME10\\n'"
        ]
      },
      "signal": { "exit_ok": true, "stdout_contains": "widgets" },
      "returns": {
        "remote": { "from": "stdout_regex", "pattern": "([a-z]+)" },
        "coupon": { "from": "stdout_regex", "pattern": "(ACME10)" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "consume-remote",
      "adapter": "cli",
      "desc": "cli：消费 ssh 读回的值（{dataset:remote}）",
      "source": "demo-tool",
      "args": ["--query={dataset:remote}"],
      "signal": { "exit_ok": true, "stdout_contains": "widget widgets" }
    },
    {
      "id": "web-coupon",
      "adapter": "web",
      "desc": "web：用数据集里的优惠券码填表并应用（命令绑定 {from:\"dataset\"}）",
      "start_url": "bench/fixtures/shop_cart.html",
      "commands": [
        { "id": "fill-coupon", "op": "fill", "target": "[data-test=coupon]", "value": { "from": "dataset", "key": "coupon" } },
        { "id": "apply-coupon", "op": "click", "target": "[data-test=apply-coupon]" }
      ],
      "signal": { "css_text_contains": ["[data-test=coupon-msg]", "Coupon applied"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "game",
      "adapter": "stdio",
      "desc": "stdio：玩一局真实交互式猜数字游戏（提示-应答-信号）",
      "stdio": {
        "argv": ["node", "bench/fixtures/guess-game.mjs", "--secret=42"],
        "script": [
          { "when": "Guess a number", "send": "50" },
          { "when": "Too high", "send": "25" },
          { "when": "Too low", "send": "37" },
          { "when": "Too low", "send": "43" },
          { "when": "Too high", "send": "40" },
          { "when": "Too low", "send": "41" },
          { "when": "Too low", "send": "42" }
        ],
        "timeout_ms": 20000
      },
      "signal": { "exit_ok": true, "stdout_contains": "You win" },
      "returns": { "tries": { "from": "stdout_regex", "pattern": "in (\\d+) tries" } }
    },
    {
      "id": "consume-tries",
      "adapter": "cli",
      "desc": "cli：消费游戏返回值（{dataset:tries} 进了 argv，桩工具把 argv 原样回显）",
      "source": "demo-tool",
      "args": ["--query={dataset:tries}"],
      "signal": { "exit_ok": true, "stdout_contains": "--query=7" }
    }
  ],
  "invariants": [
    {
      "id": "coupon-applied",
      "desc": "结束时优惠券已应用（浏览器结束态，在 cli/ssh/stdio 步骤之后仍然成立）",
      "signal": { "css_text_contains": ["[data-test=coupon-msg]", "Coupon applied"] }
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "这是**多类型应用**的完整示范：一条旅程里依次执行 web → cli → ssh → cli → web → stdio → cli，类型由适配器注册表分派，runner 里没有类型分支。",
    "返回值传递覆盖三条通路：① cli→ssh（cli 的 stdout_regex → 数据集 → ssh 远端命令的 {dataset:token}）；② ssh→数据集→浏览器命令绑定（{from:\"dataset\", key:\"coupon\"} 填表）；③ stdio→cli（游戏的返回值 → 数据集 → 下一 cli 步 argv）。缺失值一律结构化 needs_value，不猜。",
    "真实场景：ssh 是本机 sshd（key 认证）；stdio 是真实子进程的提示-应答会话（bench/fixtures/guess-game.mjs，一局 7 次猜中）。",
    "前置条件：本机 sshd 在跑且 `ssh localhost` 免交互可用。`apps:suite` 会探测该能力：不可用时**如实跳过**（跳过 ≠ 通过）；直接 `npm run apps -- --app mixed-demo` 在缺服务时如实失败。",
    "边界（Slice 3）：stdio 是行文本协议、没有 pty 语义，也不支持 retries/dangerous；ssh 的 dangerous/干跑语义未实现；ssh argv 走远端 shell（与本地 cli 的 argv-array-永不过-shell 不同，转义由声明者负责）。"
  ]
}
